      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the word \"officer\" the words \"or the person licensed under this Act\"; BILL"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (6)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the comma at the end of paragraph (e) a semicolon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (e) the following paragraph: \"(f) any person licensed under this Act,\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (7) by inserting after the words \"public servant\" wherever they appear the words \", any person licensed under this Act\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 119 the following section: 119A. Where an offence under this Act is committed by a body corporate (whether or not the body corporate has been prosecuted), every director, secretary or manager of the body corporate shall be deemed to be guilty of the offence unless he proves that the offence was committed without his consent or connivance and that he had exercised all due diligence to prevent the commission of the offence as he ought to have exercised having regard to the nature of his functions in that capacity and to all the circumstances of the case.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_7"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 126 the following section: 126. (1) Notwithstanding anything in this Act, the Minister shall have the power to authorise or grant a licence on such conditions as he may think fit to any person to undertake any function of a road transport officer under this Act as it appears to him to be necessary."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may make rules for the purposes of subsection (1), and in particular, but without prejudice to the generality of the foregoing provisions, may make rules with respect to any of the following matters:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the charges, fees or levy which shall be paid to any person authorised or licensed under subsection (1) in respect of services provided;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the qualifications of persons to be employed by the person authorised or licensed under subsection (1) and to regulate their competency;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the type of records to be kept by the person authorised or licensed under subsection (1);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to prescribe the type of returns to be submitted by the person authorised or licensed under subsection (1) to the Director General at certain intervals; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to regulate the inspection by the Director General of the premises of the person authorised or licensed under subsection (1) and the records kept thereat."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, authorise a person authorised or licensed under subsection (1) to demand, collect and retain charges, fees or levy prescribed under subsection (2) in respect of the services provided by him."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An order made under subsection (3) shall specify—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the type of services in respect of which charges, fees or levy may be demanded, collected and retained;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the person authorised to demand, collect and retain the charges, fees or levy; and BILL"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the duration of the authorisation to demand, collect and retain the charges, fees or levy."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person authorised under subsection (3) shall—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "maintain such accounts, books and records in respect of the payment and collection of charges, fees or levy as the Director General may require;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "furnish to the Director General such information, returns and accounts in respect of the payment and collection of charges, fees or levy as the Director General may require; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "permit the Director General or any officer authorised in writing by the Director General to have access to or examine or inspect any document, machinery or equipment maintained or used for the payment or collection of charges, fees or levy."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The authorisation of any person under subsection (3) shall not render the Federal Government liable to any person in respect of any injury, damage or loss occasioned by the failure of the person authorised or licensed to carry out his obligations under the Act in respect of which charges, fees or levy are demanded, collected and retained."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If a person authorised or licensed under subsection (1) contravenes or fails to comply with any condition of the authorisation or licence or any of the provisions of this section or rules made thereunder for which no penalty is expressly provided the person shall be guilty of an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both.\". ROAD TRANSPORT (AMENDMENT) 11"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_14__subsec_2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 126 the following section: . 126A. (1) An authorisation or licence issued under section 126 shall, unless sooner revoked, continue in force for such period as the Minister may determine."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_14__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/8/eng@/~part_11A__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may revoke authorisation or licence issued under section 126.\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
